worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_meta_composite.js"
  ceiling 155
  rationale "The meta reasoner's decomposition and memory (2026-10-06 meta-algorithm doctrine, R1007/R1011): a message holding several artifact requests is split into sub-goals solved by the same loop, and chunks learned by explanation-based learning leave as an append memory operation and come back through memory. Split from formal_ai_worker_meta_reasoner.js to keep that module under the 1000-line limit."
